## SOL-90: redirect legacy blogs
RewriteRule ^/en/about-us/newsroom/SK-hynix-and-Solidigm-introduce-first-collaborative-product.html$ https://news.solidigm.com/en-WW/213553-sk-hynix-and-solidigm-introduce-first-collaborative-product [L,R=301]
RewriteRule ^/en/about-us/newsroom/Introducing-Solidigm-A-Market-Leader-in-NAND-Flash-Technology.html$ https://news.solidigm.com/en-WW/212941-introducing-solidigm-a-market-leader-in-nand-flash-technology [L,R=301]
RewriteRule ^/en/about-us/newsroom/SK-hynix-completes-the-First-Phase-of-Intel-NAND-and-SSD-Business-Acquisition.html$ https://news.solidigm.com/en-WW/212943-sk-hynix-completes-the-first-phase-of-intel-nand-and-ssd-business-acquisition [L,R=301]

## VYRKCIN-440 for 403.html requests to be handled at the Apache layer
RewriteRule ^/403.html$ - [F]

## SOL-3 Sitemap.xml
RewriteRule ^/sitemap_index.xml$ /etc.clientlibs/newco-aem-site/clientlibs/clientlib-base/resources/sitemap_index.xml [PT,L]

## SOL-4 Robots.txt
RewriteRule ^/robots.txt$ /content/newco-aem-site/language-masters/en/_jcr_content.robots.txt [PT,L]

